+In this repository, `tests/conftest.py` redirects every test's reflexion writes into the test's temporary directory and checks at the end of the session that no new `.md` files appeared in `docs/mistakes/` and that `docs/memory/solutions_learned.jsonl` kept the same byte size. Keep that guard in place; see `tests/unit/test_reflexion_pollution_guard.py`.
 
